### =========================================================================
### Libros — pruebas con la extensión REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### Haz clic en "Send Request" sobre cada petición.
###
### baseUrl:
###   - Local (php artisan serve) ........ http://localhost:8000
###   - Docker, directo al backend ........ http://localhost:8010
###   - Docker, a través del frontend ..... http://localhost:8081/api
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8010
@categoryId = 1

### Health check de Laravel
GET {{baseUrl}}/up

### Versión del backend (imagen publicada en Docker Hub)
GET {{baseUrl}}/version
Accept: application/json

### Listar todos los libros
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar libros por categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?category={{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear un libro
# @name createBook
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "El nombre del viento",
  "author": "Patrick Rothfuss",
  "description": "Primera jornada de la Crónica del asesino de reyes.",
  "published_year": 2007,
  "category_id": {{categoryId}}
}

### Ver el libro recién creado
@bookId = {{createBook.response.body.$.data.id}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}
Accept: application/json

### Editar el libro
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "El nombre del viento (edición especial)",
  "author": "Patrick Rothfuss",
  "description": null,
  "published_year": 2017,
  "category_id": {{categoryId}}
}

### Eliminar el libro
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Casos de error
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Validación: campos obligatorios -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Validación: título corto, año inválido y categoría inexistente -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ab",
  "author": "Anónimo",
  "published_year": 3000,
  "category_id": 999999
}

### Filtro con categoría inexistente -> 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?category=999999
Accept: application/json

### Libro inexistente al editar -> 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/999999
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No existe",
  "author": "Nadie",
  "published_year": 2000,
  "category_id": {{categoryId}}
}

### Libro inexistente al eliminar -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/999999
Accept: application/json
